# Using Adjacent

This workspace ships Adjacent skills. Treat `using-adjacent` as the
session bootstrap: check skills before MCP calls, scripts, or orders.

- Load the matching skill before acting. Routing lives in
  `adjacent-workflows`.
- Mid quotes for every price, return, move, and tracking figure.
- No mid, move, tracking error, or P&L figure without a fresh `price`
  call or producer script in this turn.
- Never invent endpoint responses or slugs.
- Charts load `adjacent-chart-style` before render or publish.
- Trading is fail-closed. Dry-run unless the user explicitly places
  orders against a catalog with placeholders off.
